# Dealer deal visibility

Among dealer agents, **only a sales manager** (`dealer_scope: all`) may see or be notified about another agent's application. Regular agents (`assigned`) see, open, mutate, and get notified about **only deals they own** (`application.agentUserId === user.id`). Unassigned web leads belong to sales managers, not the whole floor.

Ops roles (credit, finance, admin) are a different portal and are unchanged.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — any agent at the dealership
{ role: 'dealer_agent', companyId }
user.companyId === app.companyId

// ✅ GOOD
dealerCanAccessApplication(user, app)
dealerOwnedApplicationWhere(user)
dealerAgentNotifyWhere(companyId, app.agentUserId)
```

Do not add a company-only dealer filter for applications, LPO, assist, guarantor, consents, or submit notifications.
